 up but you don't have good  angles around you to jump from  save from where you want to launch from  then do a normal wind bomb in any  direction  as soon as you get hit watch a memory  then load the save  you'll rock it skyward when you load  back in  all shop items secretly cost 9999 mon  have 100 attack and have an extra bar of  stamina until their actual material id  shows up  damn that's some strong milk camouflaged  lizalfos have really weird interactions  when you're disguised they'll typically  ignore you  unless they witness you murderize their  friend in which they'll give you a death  stare  if you approach them then they'll attack  on sight makes sense but you can then  sneak strike them after their attack  and it only does normal damage then they  just turn around and forget everything  that just happened  you alright buddy horses give absolutely  no shits about lionel's explosions  like at all  the master cycle needs refueling to keep  running and pretty much everything is  just  thrown in the fuel tank except fairies  they have a special animation blessing  the fuel tank before flying away  it looks even cooler with multiple  fairies the master cycle also has the  ability to teleport fire when redeployed  by firing a fire arrow at the master  cycle then redeploying it  it will carry the fire along with it to  save reloading assets when you redeploy  the bike it's actually just moving there  extremely fast  which means the path between the  teleportation points will also catch on  fire  i know this baby hits 88 miles an hour  one of the coolest ways to surprise your  enemies  is to side jump off a skinny tree  did you notice that octoballon's stasis  launch momentum is linked to the weight  of the attached item  if it picks up a heavy object it will  require more hits to hit max launch  velocity  while a tiny object just needs about one  arrow i mean  it makes sense every horse has a max  water depth limit they can walk in  before they kick you off an